Security Impact Analysis (SIA) was conducted for {{systemName}} production deployment. The SIA evaluated confidentiality, integrity, and availability impacts of system changes including:

**Affected Systems:**
{{#if tenant.name}}
- M365 GCC High Tenant: {{tenant.name}}
{{/if}}
{{#if infraResources}}
{{#each infraResources}}
- {{this.resourceType}}: {{this.name}}
{{/each}}
