**Risk Assessment:**
- **Confidentiality:** Azure Blob Storage access restricted via SharedKey authentication. SAS tokens enforce time-based expiry (24-hour max). Network-level access control via Azure Private Link (future).
- **Integrity:** Evidence artifacts protected with SHA-256 hash verification at capture time. Immutable blob storage tier prevents evidence tampering.
- **Availability:** Evidence Collector (EC) and Evidence Ops (EO) servers deployed with health monitoring. Blob storage provides geo-redundant backup.

**Mitigation Controls:**
- Azure Storage Firewall rules restrict access to authorized IP ranges
- TLS 1.2+ enforced for all blob storage connections
- Evidence retention policy prevents accidental deletion (90-day minimum)
- Audit logging enabled for all storage account operations

The SIA document was reviewed and approved by the ISSO prior to production deployment.

